   "line": 4,
   "text": "Why? Picture a dot on the rim of a wheel. The sample is how far left or right it sits. Those samples are the dot turning ninety degrees every sample. One thousand hertz turns forty-five degrees. Four thousand turns half a turn, so its samples flip. That's the tone as a wheel.",
